@startuml StudyForgeF14Memory
actor Student
participant AgentController
participant StudyAgentFacade
participant AgentCoordinator
participant AgentToolManager
participant MemoryManager
participant LearningHistoryService
participant ResponseSynthesizer
Student -> AgentController: request(course, goal)
AgentController -> StudyAgentFacade: agentAssist(courseId, goal)
StudyAgentFacade -> AgentCoordinator: run(courseId, goal)
AgentCoordinator -> AgentToolManager: execute(validatedSteps)
AgentToolManager --> AgentCoordinator: course-scoped tool results
AgentCoordinator -> MemoryManager: recent(courseId)
MemoryManager -> LearningHistoryService: recent(courseId, 10)
LearningHistoryService --> MemoryManager: newest ten persisted events
MemoryManager --> AgentCoordinator: typed HistoryEvent list
AgentCoordinator -> ResponseSynthesizer: synthesize(intent, results, memory)
ResponseSynthesizer --> AgentCoordinator: student-facing response
AgentCoordinator --> StudyAgentFacade: result
StudyAgentFacade --> AgentController: result
AgentController --> Student: response
note over LearningHistoryService
History is derived from flashcard reviews,
quiz attempts, and study-plan creation only;
the full page/CLI list is capped at 100.
end note
@enduml
